{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方第一块大字，先注意到珊瑚红高亮的“自己需要对方”，随后视线落到“不再藏起喜欢”。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他意识到自己需要对方，开始不再隐藏对对方的喜欢。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"喜欢、坦然、轻松，带有一点释然。\",\n  \"missed\": \"即使对方不需要他，他仍愿意陪伴的态度；以及想到两人以后未必还能亲近时，欢喜中夹杂的心疼和不安。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"第一、第二、第三块大字都比较显眼，存在一定的主视线竞争。\",\n    \"第一块文字较长，包含彼此需要、愿意陪伴、不再隐藏喜欢等多个层次。\",\n    \"下方还有连续排列的多行小字，快速扫视时不容易逐条获取。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c425f1eb-15e5-41b2-87ef-ca82369a0a0e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T023042675590Z", "elapsed_seconds": 38.328, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:31:21.001257+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "71f13043768e4f1b1a402ea1dbb1879688cb37f96d2d42d5e5535ef3403305a2", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedf